OL,3,AG7 to release 100 million barrels of
OL,4,Aoil and diesel after Trump export ban
OL,5,Athreat
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe G7 has agreed to release 100
OL,8,Fmillion barrels of oil and diesel in a
OL,9,Fbid to ease supply pressures that have
OL,10,Fcaused prices to skyrocket.
OL,12,FThe group of advanced economies,
OL,13,Fincluding the US, said the move would
OL,14,Finclude a "substantial release" of
OL,15,Fdiesel in the coming days.
OL,17,FPresident Donald Trump had threatened
OL,18,Fto ban diesel exports in a move which
OL,19,Fwould have eased pressure on prices for
OL,20,FUS consumers ahead of November's
OL,21,Fmidterm elections, but pushed up prices
OL,22,Felsewhere.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
